## Deploy and start

1. Upload the mapped artifacts in **File Management**.
2. Open **Operations Center > Job Operations > Deploy Job > Python Job**.
3. Select the target engine and fill the entry file/module, arguments, and dependency fields above.
4. Configure the documented runtime settings and deploy.
5. Start the job when ready and perform the VVR checks below.

An available job-submission skill can use the same artifacts and parameters to perform deployment when requested.

